{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hell on Earth is a fast paced action rogue-lite game, playable solo or in co-op with a friend. Battle hordes of enemies, collect gold, gems, gear, and enhance your hero to defeat powerful bosses. Choose your class, customize your hero\u2019s skills, select your appearance, and save the world from Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/HordesNBosses.png?t=1752906050\" /></div>Face overwhelming enemy swarms and take down 48 unique bosses across 12 chaotic levels, each filled with evolving threats and brutal encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/Steam_Boss_LD.gif?t=1752906050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/LootNCraft.png?t=1752906050\" /></div>Defeat bosses to collect gold, rare gear, and powerful gems. Slot gems into gear to craft builds and unlock unique perk combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/Steam_Equipment_LD.gif?t=1752906050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/CreateYourGameplay.png?t=1752906050\" /></div>Level up as you fight and choose from active spells, passives, or stat boosts. Every decision changes your playstyle mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/Steam_LevelUp_LD.gif?t=1752906050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/SoloNOnlineCo-op.png?t=1752906050\" /></div>Survive alone or team up with a friend for two-player online co-op. Combine classes and strategies to overcome the hardest challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/Multiplayer_LD.gif?t=1752906050\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/extras/ChooseYourClass.png?t=1752906050\" /></div>Pick your hero and define your role\u2014each class brings exclusive spells and unique gameplay mechanics to the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2781990?t=1752906050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/22a4fbd5f75fb164ca56262b61e7659bad04a918/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752906050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/b8374e81761329ad04ce97140ca75e6fc58ed0e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752906050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781990/b8374e81761329ad04ce97140ca75e6fc58ed0e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752906050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{